# Vault status when picking up work

**Before** writing code, dispatching an implementer, or starting research: set that card's `status: In progress` and **commit it**. The Obsidian board must show In progress while the agent works — not after the fact, not only in chat.

- One current card: `In progress`. Do not leave it `Not started`.
- When acceptance is met: `Done` in the same commit as the implementation (or immediately after).
- Parallel GPP cards: each gets `In progress` when its implementer starts, not earlier.
- Status-only commit is fine: `Mark [[card title]] in progress.`

Do not skip this because the slice is “small” or the subagent will flip Done later.
